{"screen_name": "kashi_kiduti", "first_seen": "2025-09-14T11:08:45.174673", "last_updated": "2025-09-14T11:08:45.174673", "profile": {"id": 2595503, "acceptable": false, "creator": true, "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1872291477864509441/syDGf0IH.jpg", "name": "樫 きづち@お絵描き系Vtuber", "nsfw_acceptable": false, "screen_name": "kashi_kiduti", "language": "en", "body_size": 10000, "received_works_count": 9, "received_nsfw_works_count": 0, "appeal_receivable": false, "sent_first_works_count": 0, "sent_public_works_count": 0, "instruction": "detail", "description": "樫城槌（かしきづち）です！種族は豹！主にお絵描き配信をしています！たまにシャケ！お問い合わせ等の連絡はDMか下記の連絡先からお願いします。▫️FA：#描く城槌 ▫️🔞：#打ち出の城槌▫️アイコン：@mitora_0403", "busy": false, "url": "https://www.youtube.com/@%E6%A8%AB%E5%9F%8E%E6%A7%8C-kashi_kiduti", "show_social_profile": true, "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "received_requests_average_response_time": null, "completing_average_time": null, "nc": 17, "twitter_uid": "1510177398561861632", "user_service_link": [], "banned": false, "banned_by": "", "complete_rate": 1, "og_image_url": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Ffcdn.skeb.jp%2Fassets%2Fv1%2Fcommons%2Fogp.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=1200&h=630&s=fb919ed2f719addcbe44cbdea9c1851a", "skills": [{"genre": "art", "default_amount": 9000}], "acceptable_only_public": false, "tip_acceptable": true, "yearly_report_client_visible": false, "total_appeals_count": 0, "received_works": [{"path": "/@kashi_kiduti/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2595503, "client_id": 3659874, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/398f8015/uploads/origins/583330c9-e032-41e7-a04a-2615bada7306?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=39d46b9fe2f982f7d26972cffa0006b3", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/398f8015/uploads/origins/583330c9-e032-41e7-a04a-2615bada7306?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=06210c1078813a8a0829cbd2901bd45e", "src_set": ""}, "body": "The size is 16:9. in a horizontal rectangular shape.\nI would like to have a single picture of a wreath with background included.\n\nThe character setting of Reese is\nA half-animal man. Half plant flower wolf.\nHe can use ice magic and is a scythe user.\n\nI would like to ask in the form of leaving it up to you. I will definitely use a scythe as a weapon. I hope you will include it.\nIf it's too difficult\nIce and petals are blooming and falling.\nIt's beautiful or dainty. I would appreciate it if you could draw it in a slightly cool way.\nI would appreciate it if you could draw it.\nThank you very much.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/15jq8cB3LLUNj3nmBtSgpSflhFiV7CTRB", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@kashi_kiduti/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/846d3545/uploads/origins/654ad30f-5cf2-494b-936a-3b7bd15b51f0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=6fa34846872b28e1b4289989567be67b", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2595503, "client_id": 2138683, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@kashi_kiduti/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2595503, "client_id": 1049723, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6656efb6/uploads/origins/f5bf6474-fe66-4a12-a026-a04b710dac6e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4ac6484012bc2fe1752826e388011ac8", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6656efb6/uploads/origins/f5bf6474-fe66-4a12-a026-a04b710dac6e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e10d94da18c42b3e5082d010fc1f2b63", "src_set": ""}, "body": "お菓子を食べていたあおのまきさん(カピバラ)があおのまきさん(ウサギ)に(健康に配慮して)お菓子を取り上げられて怒っているイラストをお願いします。その他についてはお任せします。\n\nhttps://skeb.jp/@kashi_kiduti/works/5", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@kashi_kiduti/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2595503, "client_id": 2695939, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9e3d884b/uploads/origins/1fa519b9-94f4-4afd-9fdc-16b201ee5914?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dfab5658146c8ff12e85b6c7f25100cf", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9e3d884b/uploads/origins/1fa519b9-94f4-4afd-9fdc-16b201ee5914?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a378c4049103780ebb7cb3d7148e68f9", "src_set": ""}, "body": "It has been a while. If you are not busy, I would appreciate your request.\n I would like to ask you to take a walk with me, Aonomaki and Kashijo Gamutsu as a family.\n Composition\nClothing: plain clothes or seasonal clothes\nBackground: Sunny beach\nLineup:First person, Kashiro Tsuchi, Back, Me & Aonomaki carrying or being carried on her shoulders.\nThank you very much in advance.", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@kashi_kiduti/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2595503, "client_id": 2138683, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/068f0844/uploads/origins/dfe953ec-f8cb-4255-ae05-dab0b2c6f100?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c4c4661deae226ebfd7542483c2b8459", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/068f0844/uploads/origins/dfe953ec-f8cb-4255-ae05-dab0b2c6f100?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5fcc2907a4305e092c4616046886031a", "src_set": ""}, "body": "I am always happy to visit your distribution. My name is Aonomaki.\nI would like to introduce myself. key visual? I would like to request a standing picture or a key visual of myself.\n\nI am a white rabbit, not so muscular, with blue eyes.\nHis ears are not drooping but pinned.\nClothing is business casual, navy blue with a long scarf. Shoes are boots.\nHis age? is \"arafô,\" but younger is also acceptable.\n\nI would like the beast to hold a stuffed capybara in his arms.\nThe capybara has narrow eyes, or rather, the type with closed eyes often seen in mascots.\nShe is wearing a blue hoodie, apron and cargo pants. You do not need to wear shoes.\nThe capibara is about the size of a stuffed animal up to the knees. It is only plush-like, not a stuffed animal.\nIt's more like my current icon.\nFor reference.\nhttps://x.com/maki_blue415/status/1540741895608864770?s=46&t=Bh9Bgzorz5pvs1Os_4N2HQ\n\nI have no problem with the production scene being played on the distribution.\nIs there anything missing? I hope not.\nBest regards.", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@kashi_kiduti/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2595503, "client_id": 2695939, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4aeaa1d8/uploads/origins/f14889a6-6140-4bbd-992d-59ad960c2b5a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=78787299276cbda6ce873dd327757b36", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4aeaa1d8/uploads/origins/f14889a6-6140-4bbd-992d-59ad960c2b5a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=82149e47e2809eec78ba1b3dee90be31", "src_set": ""}, "body": "It has been a while.\nIf you have time, we would appreciate your request.\nThis time, I would like to ask for \"two animals and autumn leaves\".\nI would like to have a composition of me and Mr. Kashikizuchi walking around looking at the autumn leaves. If it is too strict, just the composition of just me would be fine.\nI can have this one sent out.", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@kashi_kiduti/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2595503, "client_id": 2695939, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/25c24d4d/uploads/origins/94eab7d8-f003-48e7-a586-08ad79c8ab45?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1770c2643c78c3274acc3868516aa711", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/25c24d4d/uploads/origins/94eab7d8-f003-48e7-a586-08ad79c8ab45?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c0c913c89bd2ecd9953dd639c78b31da", "src_set": ""}, "body": "This is Konkizuchi.\nThis is Garcia, who requested a dragon man last time.\nThis time, I'd like to request a different outfit.\nThis time, the subject is the same as last time!\nThe same dragon man as last time.\nThe costume should be Japanese style (yukata, jinbei, etc.)\nPosing is up to you!\nThe background is also up to you!\nWe'll leave the posing up to you!\nThis request will be posted on ！！！！！！", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@kashi_kiduti/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2595503, "client_id": 2695939, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6f68bf96/uploads/origins/a690fcd0-7790-4ff3-a45a-ffad0b84d63e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=19045d0b2c90521b04f0c3b0557be897", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6f68bf96/uploads/origins/a690fcd0-7790-4ff3-a45a-ffad0b84d63e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c24a1e0e90804cf4452373ec237ecd23", "src_set": ""}, "body": "初めましてRenjiと申します。今回初のskeb依頼になるので至らないことがあるかもしれないですがご了承いただくと助かります。\nでは依頼内容ですが、体イラストをお願いしたいのですが大丈夫でしょうか。1面図で構わないので描いて頂くととても嬉しいです。\n\nそれでは、キャラ詳細は下に\n種族:龍人\n年齢:30〜45あたり\n体型:筋肉質（程々に）\n身長:170〜200の間（きづちさんの好みに）\n衣装:鎧系\nポージングはきづちさんにお任せします\nこちらの制作過程においては配信してもらっても大丈夫です。", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@kashi_kiduti/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2595503, "client_id": 1783065, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ceec8bda/uploads/origins/75939dc2-66f5-464e-bd2a-7eb4319ddf6b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5da9be2b7bfb537bc6f2c5a35bba845a", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ceec8bda/uploads/origins/75939dc2-66f5-464e-bd2a-7eb4319ddf6b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3f8698ccb15c6402e33c4c5592e72034", "src_set": ""}, "body": "はじめまして。Vtuberの望月蒼夜といいます。\n望月蒼夜、颯雅の2名で行うコラボ配信のサムネイルに使用するイラストの依頼をしたいです。\nサムネイルのほかにも動画内やSNSアイコンでも使用させて頂きたいです。\nまた、コラボ相手である颯雅にも同じく使用許可を頂けると幸いです。\n配信内容がゲーム配信なのでコントローラを持っているなど、ゲームを想像させるようなものだと嬉しいですが、ゲームが関係なくても大丈夫です。\nキャラ全体を映すか、どのようなポーズをさせるか、構図はお任せしたいと思います。\nまた、望月蒼夜に関しましては服装は自由に変更していただいても大丈夫です。\nよろしくお願いいたします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1nXOpEBLSFMzPFWoND7mAfg9Rkyyur4bX?usp=sharing", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 394581, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "ユタリビャク☀", "screen_name": "byaku_yutari", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1352468317638823938/tbO0sm_8.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1129765432267661312/1559660936/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 129}, {"id": 973259, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "日帰りおんせん渥美", "screen_name": "floating_atsumi", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1717923225676791808/bRN73-F0.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/848904945168338944/1650706849/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "nc": 16}, {"id": 2413378, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "五十鈴響🔔🐾アイドルわんこVtuber", "screen_name": "isuzu_kyo", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1766104872750055424/CFArB-SF.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1365317137657589767/1667296776/150